@startuml InfraTrack-Activity
|Citizen|
start
:Open app;
:Capture photo;
:Confirm GPS location;
:Choose category + describe;
:Submit report;
|System|
:Validate input;
:AI severity analysis;
:Attribute jurisdiction (governorate / municipality);
:Save Issue (status = REPORTED);
:Record StatusEvent;
|Authority|
:Review in triage dashboard;
if (Valid issue?) then (no)
  :Set REJECTED;
  |System|
  :Record StatusEvent;
  stop
else (yes)
  |Authority|
  :Set ACKNOWLEDGED;
  :Assign to staff;
  :Set IN_PROGRESS;
  :Carry out repair;
  :Set RESOLVED;
  |System|
  :Record StatusEvent (per change);
endif
|Citizen|
:View status updates / public timeline;
stop
@enduml
